On May 8, 2014, at 6:53 PM, Lngmyers <lngmyers-wxfK21ZMRnh9nmWX13WWKA at public.gmane.org> wrote:

> 
> As usual, I'm late to the party (time zones etc). But thanks, all, for the rich discussion sparked by my stupid question (though really, it's a shame that the "Doraemon" comic hasn't been translated into English). I look forward to trying out Henrik Singmann's afex package and reading the refs written and/or suggested by Roger Levy.
